**/node_modules
.git
.gitignore
*.md
# ...but the web build bakes CHANGELOG.md into the changelog modal at build time
!CHANGELOG.md
dist
.env
.env.*
config/default.yml

# Tests never run inside the image, and they are not small: 235 *.test.ts files
# under packages/api alone were being COPY'd into the runtime stage. Excluding
# them from the build CONTEXT keeps them out of both stages — the web build does
# not need specs either (tsconfig.app.json excludes them).
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/__fixtures__
